{"4265830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spyder: Agent 8", "steam_appid": 4265830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the BAFTA award-winning studio Sumo Digital comes a one-of-a-kind spy adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a retro-futuristic 1970s spy world, you play as Agent 8: the world's tiniest and most adorable robot spider superspy. Built by the British Spy Agency S.A.F.E using experimental technology, Agent 8 was made for top-secret missions. With sticky sucker feet that cling to any surface, this little spy can crawl anywhere — even upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to stop the evil organisation S.I.N and save the world. From rescuing astronauts to sabotaging a submarine or stopping a speeding train, every level is packed with tiny spy-sized missions. Use Agent 8’s gadgets to slip past obstacles, explore every corner, and uncover clever surprises. It’s all about problem-solving, stealth, and adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your Spyder skills and become the ultimate superspy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/fcb56b670c7120cf1bbe9daf7b776bc5.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/fcb56b670c7120cf1bbe9daf7b776bc5.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Agent 8, a tiny spy gadget that moves like a real spider! A clever, charming hero who can crawl into every hidden corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/7f4a96221fc95324da2abbe52936aec7.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/7f4a96221fc95324da2abbe52936aec7.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through exciting maps and complete daring missions. Hide from cameras, stay undetected, and outsmart obstacles before disaster strikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/d4bf7bd086bfba8962181b2488d2b49a.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/d4bf7bd086bfba8962181b2488d2b49a.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with all the gadgets and gizmos you’ll need, use tools like your cutting torch to slice through panels or your web grapple to swing across gaps as you take on exciting spy missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/916f808a6f5084a07aa9daba02ef8965.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/916f808a6f5084a07aa9daba02ef8965.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve fun environmental puzzles! Push, pull, and launch objects to open secret paths, trigger surprises, and find creative ways to complete each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/dc1d23fe4dc9fbf67e56bd91c01a8dd9.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/dc1d23fe4dc9fbf67e56bd91c01a8dd9.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a colorful retro world inspired by 1970s spy films. Detailed, lively visuals bring every mission to life, making you feel like a true superspy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/0f9af0f34f84c17294ff60cd4caa119f.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/0f9af0f34f84c17294ff60cd4caa119f.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crawl upside down, across walls, ceilings, and floors while the camera smoothly follows your moves. Take control or let it guide you for full crawling fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/f6f453faf82c0f3313b94db65bb1718f.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/f6f453faf82c0f3313b94db65bb1718f.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play levels again and again to uncover hidden treasures, find collectibles, and unlock achievements. A Spyder’s mission isn’t over until every secret is discovered!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the BAFTA award-winning studio Sumo Digital comes a one-of-a-kind spy adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a retro-futuristic 1970s spy world, you play as Agent 8: the world's tiniest and most adorable robot spider superspy. Built by the British Spy Agency S.A.F.E using experimental technology, Agent 8 was made for top-secret missions. With sticky sucker feet that cling to any surface, this little spy can crawl anywhere — even upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to stop the evil organisation S.I.N and save the world. From rescuing astronauts to sabotaging a submarine or stopping a speeding train, every level is packed with tiny spy-sized missions. Use Agent 8’s gadgets to slip past obstacles, explore every corner, and uncover clever surprises. It’s all about problem-solving, stealth, and adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your Spyder skills and become the ultimate superspy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/fcb56b670c7120cf1bbe9daf7b776bc5.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/fcb56b670c7120cf1bbe9daf7b776bc5.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Agent 8, a tiny spy gadget that moves like a real spider! A clever, charming hero who can crawl into every hidden corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/7f4a96221fc95324da2abbe52936aec7.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/7f4a96221fc95324da2abbe52936aec7.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through exciting maps and complete daring missions. Hide from cameras, stay undetected, and outsmart obstacles before disaster strikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/d4bf7bd086bfba8962181b2488d2b49a.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/d4bf7bd086bfba8962181b2488d2b49a.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with all the gadgets and gizmos you’ll need, use tools like your cutting torch to slice through panels or your web grapple to swing across gaps as you take on exciting spy missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/916f808a6f5084a07aa9daba02ef8965.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/916f808a6f5084a07aa9daba02ef8965.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve fun environmental puzzles! Push, pull, and launch objects to open secret paths, trigger surprises, and find creative ways to complete each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/dc1d23fe4dc9fbf67e56bd91c01a8dd9.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/dc1d23fe4dc9fbf67e56bd91c01a8dd9.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a colorful retro world inspired by 1970s spy films. Detailed, lively visuals bring every mission to life, making you feel like a true superspy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/0f9af0f34f84c17294ff60cd4caa119f.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/0f9af0f34f84c17294ff60cd4caa119f.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crawl upside down, across walls, ceilings, and floors while the camera smoothly follows your moves. Take control or let it guide you for full crawling fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras/f6f453faf82c0f3313b94db65bb1718f.avif?t=1786549522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/extras_big/f6f453faf82c0f3313b94db65bb1718f.webp?t=1786549522 width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play levels again and again to uncover hidden treasures, find collectibles, and unlock achievements. A Spyder’s mission isn’t over until every secret is discovered!</p>", "short_description": "Save the world as Agent 8, a robot spider superspy! Crawl across walls, ceilings, and floors, and use built-in gadgets to solve fun environmental puzzles in this brand-new, family-friendly adventure from the BAFTA Award-winning studio Sumo Digital.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/b0eeebdf28357dc1ecae1bbe2242e24eea396c6e/header.jpg?t=1786549522", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/4039d0a14648455d74c0a4fd28b32ad58640fe15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786549522", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4265830/4039d0a14648455d74c0a4fd28b32ad58640fe15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786549522", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBC<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBC<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBC</li></ul>"